{"unit_id":"tag:03N4:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n要仅仅通过“增加”额外的开集合（sets）来细化 Zariski 拓扑（topology），是非常困难的。定义拓扑（topology）的一种有效方法，是不仅考虑开集合（sets），还考虑其上的一些概形（schemes）。为定义平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑（topology），我们考虑所有平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）的态射（morphisms）<MATH_0001>。如果 <MATH_0002> 是 <MATH_0003> 上的光滑（smooth）射影簇（projective variety），那么这意味着\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0004> 是光滑（smooth）簇（varieties）的不交并（disjoint union），并且\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0005> 在解析意义下局部是同构（isomorphism）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n“解析意义”指的是 <MATH_0006> 上通常的（超越的）拓扑（topology）。因此，第二个条件意味着 <MATH_0007> 的导数（derivative）处处具有满秩（full rank）（特别地，<MATH_0008> 的所有分支（components）都与 <MATH_0009> 具有相同的维数（dimension））。\n\n<STRUCT_0006><STRUCT_0007>\n双重覆盖（double cover）——粗略地定义为簇（varieties）之间的有限（finite）次数（degree）为 <MATH_0010> 的映射（map）——例如\n<MATH_0011>\n如果有一个仅由单点组成的纤维（fibre），就不是平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）态射（morphism）。在此例中，这发生于 <MATH_0012> 时。要使 <MATH_0013> 上的簇（varieties）之间的有限（finite）映射（map）平展（<ACCENT_0004>tale），所有纤维（fibers）都应有相同的点数。从例中映射（map）的源去掉点 <MATH_0014>，就会使该态射（morphism）平展（<ACCENT_0005>tale）。但我们也可以从该态射（morphism）的源去掉其他点，该态射（morphism）仍然平展（<ACCENT_0006>tale）。为考虑平展（<ACCENT_0007>tale）拓扑（topology），我们必须考察所有这样的态射（morphisms）。与 Zariski 拓扑（topology）不同，它们不必只是 <MATH_0015> 的开子集（open subsets），尽管其像（images）总是如此。\n\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"开集合"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"开集合"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"projective variety","target_term":"射影簇"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"varieties","target_term":"簇"},{"source_term":"disjoint union","target_term":"不交并"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"derivative","target_term":"导数"},{"source_term":"full rank","target_term":"满秩"},{"source_term":"components","target_term":"分支"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数"},{"source_term":"double cover","target_term":"双重覆盖"},{"source_term":"varieties","target_term":"簇"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"次数"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"varieties","target_term":"簇"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"fibers","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"open subsets","target_term":"开子集"},{"source_term":"images","target_term":"像"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"开集合","context":"原文 open sets，保留 open 限定，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"projective variety","target_term":"射影簇","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"varieties","target_term":"簇","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"disjoint union","target_term":"不交并","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"iso