{"unit_id":"tag:03N5:statement","translation":"态射族（family of morphisms）<MATH_0001> 称为 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>平展覆盖（<ACCENT_0001>tale covering）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果每个 <MATH_0002> 都是平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphism），且它们的像（images）覆盖 <MATH_0003>，即\n<MATH_0004>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"étale covering","target_term":"平展覆盖"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"images","target_term":"像"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"étale covering","target_term":"平展覆盖","context":"所定义的术语，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"images","target_term":"像","context":"暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03N4:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n这就“定义”了平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑（topology）。换言之，我们现在可以说明什么是层（sheaves）。<MATH_0001> 是 <MATH_0002> 上的集合（sets）（分别为<SPACE_0001>阿贝尔群（abelian groups）、向量空间（vector spaces）等）的 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）层（sheaf）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，指的是如下数据：\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> 对每个平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>，给定一个集合（set）（分别为<SPACE_0002>阿贝尔群（abelian group）、向量空间（vector space）等）<MATH_0004>；\n<STRUCT_0004> 对 <MATH_0006> 上的每一对平展（<ACCENT_0004>tale）概形（schemes）<MATH_0005>，以及 <MATH_0008> 上的每个态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>（它自动是平展（<ACCENT_0005>tale）的），给定一个限制映射（map）\n<MATH_0009>。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n这些数据必须满足：对恒等态射（identity morphism）<MATH_0011>，有 <MATH_0010>；在有 <MATH_0014> 上平展（<ACCENT_0006>tale）的概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）<MATH_0013> 时，有 <MATH_0012>；并满足如下 <TEXTITOPEN_0002>层（sheaf）公理<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>：\n<STRUCT_0006>\n<ITEMOPEN_0001>(*)<ITEMCLOSE_0001> 对每个平展（<ACCENT_0007>tale）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0015>，图（diagram）\n<MATH_0016>\n是集合（sets）（分别为<SPACE_0003>阿贝尔群（abelian groups）、向量空间（vector spaces）等）范畴（category）中的等化子（equalizer）图（diagram）。\n<STRUCT_0007>\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"vector spaces","target_term":"向量空间"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"abelian group","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"vector space","target_term":"向量空间"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"限制映射"},{"source_term":"identity morphism","target_term":"恒等态射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"vector spaces","target_term":"向量空间"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"vector spaces","target_term":"向量空间","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"abelian group","target_term":"阿贝尔群","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"vector space","target_term":"向量空间","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"限制映射","context":"原文 restriction map，保留限制限定，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"identity morphism","target_term":"恒等态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子","context":"暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03N6:statement","translation":"在最后一项陈述中，必须记住 <MATH_0001> 的情形，这在一般情况下是一个极不平凡的条件（与 Zariski 拓扑（topology）中的情况不同）。事实上，重要的覆盖（coverings）往往只有一个元素（element）。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03N4:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n由于恒等映射（identity）是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism），我们可以计算平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）层（sheaf）的整体截面（global sections），而上同调（cohomology）就是相应的右导出函子（derived functors）。换言之，在发展更多理论并使陈述精确之后，定义上同调（cohomology）将没有障碍。\n\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等映射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"global sections","target_term":"整体截面"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"derived functors","target_term":"右导出函子"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等映射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"global sections","target_term":"整体截面","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"derived functors","target_term":"右导出函子","context":"原文 right-derived functors，保留右侧限定，暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
